TYPE Codes
     Cod AS STRING * 4  'code
     Typ AS STRING * 1  'type
     Des AS STRING * 24 'description
     Rat AS STRING * 3  'rate code
     Del AS STRING * 1  'delete
     Grp AS STRING * 2  'group
     Cmb AS STRING * 2  'combo code
     Fmv AS STRING * 3  'fair market value
     Dtr AS STRING * 1  'drop terms
     Dfm AS STRING * 1  'drop FMV
     Dep AS STRING * 2  'depreciation
     Fil AS STRING * 6  'filler
     END TYPE

